    "referrals": [
      "POL-RD-06(c) driver-conduct review: the repeat-deviation pattern is established on driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d = 4 against 210 completed trips in 90 days, so this driver's conduct on TRP-00502 is referred to driver-conduct review. The referral does not displace or delay the monetary ruling."
