    {
      "claim": "This case does not escalate. The trace is not impaired for policy purposes: EV-GPS-00502 has 100.0% coverage, zero gaps, max_gap_sec 0.0, a 10-second sampling interval equal to the 10-second expected interval and 145 fixes, so none of POL-RD-07 limbs (a) to (c) is met and POL-RD-10(3) does not fire. Nor does POL-RD-10(5) fire on the missing advisory, because the driver cites no advisory identifier at all: under POL-RD-13 an assertion that cites no artifact cannot be invoked against one, and the absence of an artifact no party has cited is a gap in the bundle rather than a contradiction in it. The deviation stands at the measured figure and the refund issues; the missing advisory merely makes the excuse weightless.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-00502-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}

